[p]Hello everyone! We are a small team working hard every day to make Reality Rash even better.

Here are some fixes and balance adjustments for you:

Reformulation of several Jessy and Fred attacks for less laggy and more dynamic movement;

Several fixes to prevent various types of softlocks (sorry if this happened to you at any point);

Enemies' interaction with walls may not have worked correctly, but now it does;

Fire was not displayed correctly in low/medium definition graphics;

Please use the community to leave your suggestions or report any issues you may have, we promise to resolve them as quickly as possible.

Keep beating them up!

[/p]

[p][b]Reality Rash[/b] will be available for purchase here on Steam at the June 19th! And to ensure that your journey fighting through multiple realities is the best possible, we have been working on several optimizations over the last few months:

[list]
[*] We have made the game available in new languages;
[*] We have introduced cheat codes;
[*] We have added achievements for players;
[*] We have balanced enemy stats;
[*] Another round of testing to identify and fix bugs;
[*] General improvements to the user experience; 
[/list]

We are very excited to fully present this game to the world, which is so dear to us, the developers at Give your jumps studio, that we have been working on it for the last few years, correcting, redoing, polishing and refining it until we get the best result.

We hope that you can have as much fun as possible on this extradimensional journey and, if we are successful in this goal, we would greatly appreciate it if you could leave a positive [b]review[/b].
Many thanks to everyone who has followed our development journey thus far. Now you better hurry, because Cyrus awaits in the dark depths of the Pasargada Corporation![/p]

    • Performance optimization, running the game faster;
    • New combos;
    • New fighting animations;
    • Added character illustrations during in-game dialogues;
    • Corrections of errors found during testing;

The release date is approaching, so keep an eye on our page so you don't miss any news!
